# The debug-channel counter lives in DebugVersion.xcconfig, and must never move back here.
# Any commit touching THIS file is read as a release bump by scripts/release-metadata.sh, so a
# debug build published between two releases truncated the next release's notes to whatever
# came after it. See the note in that file.
